%% High-level architecture of the implemented MCP-based Agentic XAI system.
flowchart TB
    U[Participant or researcher<br/>text sample and question]:::interface
    S[Agentic XAI system<br/>MCP client plus controller]:::controller
    P[Depression prediction<br/>shared local classifier]:::tool
    E[Explanation evidence tools<br/>SHAP, RAG, counterfactual]:::tool
    G[Client-side explanation generation<br/>Gemini prompt builders]:::generator
    O[Prediction explanation<br/>returned to user or study cache]:::output

    U --> S
    S --> P
    S --> E
    P --> G
    E --> G
    G --> O

